  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/FVrzKQ4/falling-leaves.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/falling-leaves-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/463155.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/falling-leaves-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_463155_downloads.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffallingleavesforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/enchantmentmachine?color=00AF5C&label=modrinth&style=flat&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.gnu.org%252flicenses%252flgpl-3.0\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/License-LGPL v3-blue.svg\" alt=\"授權：LGPL v3\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmaven.paube.de%252freleases%252fde%252fcheaterpaul%252ffallingleaves%252fFallingleaves\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://badgen.net/maven/v/metadata-url/https/maven.paube.de/releases/de/cheaterpaul/fallingleaves/Fallingleaves/maven-metadata.xml\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>此 Minecraft 1.16+ 的 Forge 模組為樹葉方塊加入了精緻的粒子效果。使用者可設定哪些類型的樹葉方塊會掉落樹葉，以及掉落頻率。本模組為純客戶端模組。</p>\n<p>這是從 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/falling-leaves-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Falling Leaves (Fabric)</a> 移植而來（將配置介面替換為數據包，詳情請見下方）。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qRYkDjk/Y6zGq33.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>設定：</h2>\n<p>您可以在配置資料夾中的 <code>fallingleaves-client.toml</code> 檔案內設定以下選項：</p>\n<p><code>leafSize</code>：調整樹葉的尺寸</p>\n<p><code>leafLifespan</code>：調整樹葉消失所需的時間</p>\n<p><code>leafSpawnRate</code>：調整生成的樹葉數量</p>\n<p><code>coniferLeafSpawnRate</code>：調整針葉樹生成的樹葉數量</p>\n<p><code>dropFromPlayerPlacedBlocks</code>：玩家放置的方塊是否也會掉落樹葉</p>\n<p><code>minimumFreeSpaceBelow</code>：樹葉生成所需在樹葉方塊下方的最小空間</p>\n<p><code>disableWind</code>：停用樹葉粒子的風力效果</p>\n<p><code>windlessDimension</code>：不產生風力的維度類型清單</p>\n<h4>1.3.0</h4>\n<p><code>seasonFallRate</code>：Serene Seasons 模組的落葉速率修正清單</p>\n<h2>數據包：</h2>\n<h3>1.3.0 版本之前</h3>\n<p>除了預先定義的值之外，您可以透過嵌入值將樹葉定義為針葉樹。您需要依照 <code>data/modid/fallingleaves/blockname.json</code> 中嵌入值的相同模式建立數據包，並使用以下語法與預設值：</p>\n<pre><code>{\n  &quot;spawnrate&quot;: 1.0,\n  &quot;isConifer&quot;: false\n}\n</code></pre>\n<h3>2.0.0 版本起</h3>\n<p>所有功能請參閱此處：<a href=\"https://github.com/Cheaterpaul/fallingleaves/wiki#for-2xx\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Cheaterpaul/fallingleaves/wiki#for-2xx</a></p>",
